# A guitar-like saw pluck pattern with P1 swept loose -> tight -> loose (the length glides) with dry and springs at -3 dB each (pan 64).
tempo 110
steps 48
tail 2
track fx1
input saw 165 0.4
param p2 160
param pan 64
param level 255
gain 1
sweep p1 0 255 0 24
sweep p1 255 0 24 48
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below 0
